WEBVTT

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.010
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.250
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.080
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.590
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.960
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.530
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:56.570
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:59.240
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.440
Give thanks!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.640
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:10.450
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:15.590
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:20.860
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:25.030
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:31.100
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.910
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:36.470
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.080
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:43.350
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:49.020
Someone once said:

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.760
There is a forest where grow giant 
balls of salmon roe big as grapes...

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:59.500
There is a cave in which 
the highest grade butter

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.900
forms along the rim of a spring

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.400
into which collects droplets 
of super-rich milk

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.570
dripping down from tips of stalactites...

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:08.340
The Milkcave!

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.580
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:16.180
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.890
Toriko and his friends have managed to reach

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.920
the cavern lagoon in search 
of the Puffer Whale.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:27.360
Up against a Devil Python, Toriko and 
Coco were faced with a tough battle,

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.190
but Toriko exploded with 
a Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:35.070
On the other hand, the kidnapped Komatsu 
is facing an even greater danger...

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:41.970
The Knocking Master! Time 
to Taste the Puffer Whale!

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:50.180
Demon Devil Python (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 25

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.420
D-Demon Devil Python!

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.520
Take this, monster!

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:57.820
Bait! Bait, bait!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.060
What the...

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.770
Uh-oh... This is dangerous.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.770
My brain needs sugar!

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.280
Think more, me!

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.350
Hurry. We have to find Komatsu<i>-kun</i>.

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.210
Don't be in such a rush.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:26.020
I made sure to give Komatsu a secret weapon.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.490
Here it is!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.890
This is it!

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:36.590
Komatsu... Just in case you 
end up alone, use these.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.260
These are my special firecrackers.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.600
Fire crackers?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:44.700
I fiddled around with the amount of 
gunpowder, so it'll create a huge bang.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.210
Heavy...

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.470
Reacting with fear to sound

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.840
is the most primitive instinct 
all living creatures have.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.010
Don't forget to use these earplugs 
when you use them, okay?

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.550
I have to use the earplugs!

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.660
It's so stiff!

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.120
That explosion just now...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:32.820
Let's hurry.

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.890
I saw the shadow of death on Komatsu.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.390
My fortunes are accurate to 97%...

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.590
But the other 3% is wrong!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.830
Komatsu<i>-kun</i>!

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.270
I-I can't see anything!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.870
What happened?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.310
What a racket... Who's makin' all the noise?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:03.950
There's someone tryin' to taste sake with 
Puffer Whale fin over here, ya know...

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.690
Komatsu<i>-kun</i>!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.730
Komatsu!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.100
Toriko<i>-san</i>! Coco<i>-san</i>!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.470
I was so scared!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.140
I'm glad you're okay!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:27.310
No... I mean, I actually died once!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.340
Huh? What are you saying?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.210
I was saved by a giant old man!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.880
Giant old man?

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.180
What's going on?

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.350
The shadow of death has 
disappeared around Komatsu<i>-kun</i>.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.420
And this Devil Python has been Knocked!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:44.760
There is only one person who could do that...

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:50.030
He sure was lucky I happened 
to be passing by...

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.830
That lad must really have good luck.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:06:00.740
Oh? Not even phased by that 
sound? Impressive, as I thought.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:22.230
My, oh my... This boy is 
the one from the train.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:29.900
Did his heart stop because of 
the shock from the explosion?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:33.070
His eardrums have burst, too...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.210
I owe this boy and his friend 
for the booze they gave me.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.550
Good, he's back.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:51.690
Next, with this, I'll fix his eardrums up.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.860
Now you're good as new.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:55.990
Come on, wake up.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:07:01.430
You should make the most of the 
second life you just received.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.670
It's a giant old man monster!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:09.340
Monster? I saved your life!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.010
My life?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.510
Now that you mention it, I was...

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.850
Now then, be careful.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.180
U-Uh...

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.050
Oh, that's right.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.220
There's something strange 
I've never seen before

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:27.230
heading toward the cavern lagoon...

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:31.460
Once you catch the Puffer Whales, 
you should go back immediately.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:41.540
Although those kids ain't bad, even 
coming to a place with Devil Pythons...

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:45.940
That must have been the 
Knocking Master, Jiro.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.910
W-Who's that?

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.350
The legendary Gourmet Hunter, 
Knocking Master Jiro.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.350
His Full Course menu is almost mystical,

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:58.590
filled with things most people 
of the world have never tasted.

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.290
Their capture level can't be measured.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.960
Hors d'oeuvre: Hundred Leaf Clover.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Hundred Leaf Clover (Natural Vegetable) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Doham Spring Sake (Alcohol) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Royal Land Shark (Fish) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
E.T. Rice (Grain) Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Oasis Melon (Fruit) Capture 
Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Ashurasaurus (Dinosaurian Beast) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Grana Lettuce (Vegetable) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:19.840
Magma Consomme (Natural Food) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:06.530
Drink: Doham Spring Sake.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.800
Fish: Royal Land Shark.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.670
Main: E.T. Rice.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.100
Dessert: Oasis Melon.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.710
Meat: Ashurasaurus.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.810
Salad: Grana Lettuce.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.840
Soup: Magma Consomme.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.280
I thought I smelled something familiar...

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:26.750
It was the old man on the 
train who wanted a drink, huh?

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.050
The white-haired drunk old fool?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.460
He was that giant old guy?

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:35.760
I heard that he retired quite a while ago.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.230
He was a famously heavy drinker.

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:43.400
I guess he was looking forward to some 
once-a-decade sake with Puffer Whale fin.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.140
Okay, we're gonna get some, too!

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:47.470
Let's head out!

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.140
Right!

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.480
Komatsu<i>-kun</i> and Coco are 
there with Toriko, too!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.340
I'm an extra-helping of relieved!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.680
Now they can get some Puffer Whales!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.550
That's what you were worried about?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:01.220
Oh, it's those pretty boy 
Gourmet Hunters from before!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.590
Hey, don't leave the helmet!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.790
Oh, Komatsu<i>-kun</i>, your helmet.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.790
Whoopsie.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:14.700
Komatsu, don't forget the debt 
you owe for him saving your life.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:18.470
You'd better cook that old 
man a splendid feast one day!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.700
Right!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:23.740
In that case, Toriko<i>-san</i>, I'll be 
counting on you to get the ingredients!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.710
Hey, look!

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.180
He's not listening at all...

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.180
We're finally here!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:36.520
This is the cavern lagoon...

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.230
It's so beautiful!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.230
Now, let's get capturing!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.900
The flavor of the ocean depths!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.070
All right!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.770
The first time the cavern lagoon'll 
be shown to the public!

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.680
I told you, don't leave the helmet behind!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:06.850
I had heard that the Puffer Whale will 
only lay its eggs on clean sandy beaches,

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.790
but I never realized it 
would be <i>this</i> crystal clear.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:30.170
The Puffer Whale shouldn't be this big!

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:33.410
It's... just too big!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:43.320
The Puffer Whale was once 
about 6 meters in length,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:50.730
Puffer Whale (Marine Mammal) Capture Level 29

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.520
but due to the pressure in 
the ocean depths, it shrunk.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.990
That's why, when they lay eggs,

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.730
they have an instinct to form together 
into one to protect themselves.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.970
It looks like we hit a 
once-a-century jackpot.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.400
W-We can grab all we want!

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:58.170
Stop it, Toriko!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.010
Shoot! I scared it, and it turned poisonous!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.710
Toriko<i>-san</i>!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.610
Don't come over here swimming like that!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.520
They'll all turn poisonous!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.320
Toriko, move back.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.620
Extinguish Life.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:21.860
Extinguish your own signs 
of life... Extinguish Life.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:25.230
I thought Coco had actually 
disappeared for a second.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:28.570
He's gone and hidden himself 
from the Puffer Whales...

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.300
Lower my consciousness...

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.470
Quietly, carefully...

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.270
That's a delicate-type Knocking Gun.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.810
Have my consciousness melt 
into the ocean waters...

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.350
Knocking...

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:54.060
Lowering his consciousness, and 
concentrating quietly and carefully...

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.060
Way to go, Coco... You're doing great!

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:59.900
So... Something like this?

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.800
Toriko's wild aura has quieted down.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.110
Where did he go?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.380
I can't sense him at all!

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.580
He grasped the technique 
just from watching me?

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.150
He really does have amazing senses.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:19.950
Here.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:23.920
It's okay. I don't need a Knocking Gun.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:33.230
I can take it using my own way!

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.070
Knocking.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.850
To capture a Puffer Whale 
in an instant like that...

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:58.190
Your growth as a Gourmet Hunter 
just won't stop, will it?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.960
I got them, Komatsu!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.100
Wow!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:09.430
Two of the Four Heavenly Kings 
only managed to get 14...

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.470
Pathetic, don't you think?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.670
Just catching one is hard enough.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.440
This is really amazing!

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:17.480
Whoa there...

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.710
Looks like the young'uns 
are growing up nicely.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:28.690
Can they really become the ultimate 
chef and ultimate Gourmet Hunter?

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:33.160
Perhaps the day will come 
when they'll be able to get

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.960
that ingredient that was 
even out of my reach.

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.830
Now is when the real challenge starts.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.430
The market value for one Puffer 
Whale is about 100 million,

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:47.740
but if we can completely take out the 
poison sac, that jumps up to 500 million.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.510
However, if it turns poisonous, 
they become worthless.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.810
Hey, I can't see!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.680
And this was the good part!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.250
Delicious...

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.920
Komatsu<i>-kun</i>, will you handle 
the preparation instead of me?

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.860
M-Me?

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.600
Maybe it's fatigue, but my grip is weak.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:16.100
Just one millimeter off, and 
the poison will be released.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.770
B-But...

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.070
It's okay. You're a professional 
chef, right, Komatsu<i>-kun</i>?

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:23.610
I'll tell you exactly how to do it.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:24.880
Have confidence.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.010
You sure?

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.250
In that case, I'll take on this challenge!

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:35.590
Preparing a Puffer Whale 
is like a dream of mine!

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.920
If Komatsu is doing it, 
we'd better take more!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.930
We'll never have enough!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.190
The Puffer Whales are all gone.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.360
What do you mean?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.400
They've laid their eggs, so 
it's about time they returned.

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.470
The Puffer Whales can only survive 
in these shallows for a few hours.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.910
Then, I only have 9 chances.

00:14:57.340 --> 00:15:00.010
This is really hard for you 
too, isn't it, Coco<i>-san</i>?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.710
It's okay. You can do it 
as long as you stay calm.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.750
Everything is riding on my hands...

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:09.220
Amazing...

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.490
The blades are finished so sharp, 
they seem almost moist...

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:14.560
Those knives have been well cared for...

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.190
I can tell just from looking at his tools...

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.830
I can tell just how wonderful 
a chef Komatsu<i>-kun<i> is!</i></i>

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:25.300
Beneath the Puffer Whale's air 
bladder is its poison sac.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.640
First, make a 10 cm cut with the knife,

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.440
starting from the base of the tail fin, 
just as if you were filleting a fish.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.410
That's different than before...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.980
Each Puffer Whale's poison sac is different.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:38.280
The method to prepare them is different.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:40.180
I-I see...

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.250
Take it slowly...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:41.990
Right.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:45.360
You stopped precisely at 10 cm, I see.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.990
The flesh is extremely heavy...

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:51.360
Is this the heaviness that 
the Puffer Whale has?

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:55.730
Next, make a cut from the gills 
to the bone of the lower jaw.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:56.370
Right.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:15:59.900
Excellent!

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:06.180
This is difficult... I can't be off 
with my knife by even a millimeter!

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:09.810
It's like I'm defusing a bomb!

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:16.490
So close! This is what happens when 
you're only 1 millimeter off...

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.660
This is the final one...

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.900
Take your time. Nice and slow...

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.600
I have to do something.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.600
We've come all this way!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.870
I have to do something!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.750
I can see it! That's the poison sac!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.650
T-This is?

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.350
From now on, use your hands.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.650
Peel away the membranes 
from around the poison sac,

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.390
being careful not to break it.

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:52.020
Right.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.790
Slowly... Slowly...

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:57.100
Once you've peeled away the 
membranes, carefully scoop it out.

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.000
Don't be scared. Slowly...

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:02.000
Carefully...

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.040
Don't be scared...

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.370
Slowly...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:20.320
All right! It's a success!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.620
All right!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:24.920
Thank goodness...

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.790
You did great, Komatsu<i>-kun</i>.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:31.300
No... It's because of your 
careful instructions, Coco<i>-san</i>!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:35.170
Komatsu, this is the first time I'm 
actually glad you tagged along!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.570
Right! Thank you very much!

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:40.970
But it's my fault so many turned poisonous...

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:44.640
Yes... The IGO can use them in its research.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.750
All right! So then, let's eat!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.250
I can see it!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.920
They're super-sized in my way!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.490
Move it, move it!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.450
What, they brought the whole family?!

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:59.120
I give thanks to all this world's bounty!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.030
Let's eat!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.630
Now then, let's try some sashimi...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.900
Hey, you're taking too much!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:12.540
So sweet! So fatty and delicious!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:15.610
Like the highest quality 
marbled meat of a minke whale,

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.140
combined with the fatty 
flesh of a bluefin tuna!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:21.880
Delicious! The taste keeps 
coming, each and every bite!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.650
The more I bite, the more my 
jaw hurts... But I can't stop!

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.920
My fatigue is gone in an instant!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.490
I'd heard that it worked like a nutrient 
supplement, but nothing like this!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:37.130
Toriko<i>-san</i>, I've finished the 
hot sake with Puffer Whale fin!

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.230
Great!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.830
Delicious! This sake is incredible!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.370
The fragrance is going 
through my entire body!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:50.340
The sweetness of the fin layers on top 
of the dry taste of the hot sake...

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.110
It's passing through every cell in my body!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.150
How do you like the Puffer Whale 
that you prepared yourself?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.450
It's delicious!

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.590
I've never tasted anything like it!

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:05.690
Nothing's better than something you 
worked hard to catch and cook, right?

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:06.460
Right!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.960
I'd forgotten the joy of these moments.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:13.360
Gourmet Hunter, huh? Maybe 
I should start up again...

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.270
Thank you for this excellent meal!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:17.870
You've got to be kidding me!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.910
I didn't get even 1 gram's worth 
of a shot of anything good!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:25.410
I guess I'm the only one who 
could capture a Puffer Whale.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.410
Even so... Gourmet Hunter 
Toriko really is amazing!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:31.420
If I stick with him, there's a 100% chance 
I'll encounter amazing ingredients!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.620
Next time, I'll succeed for sure!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.730
Okay, let's head home!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.290
What's that?

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.140
This guy's trouble!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.880
Komatsu, stand back!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.220
That's an extremely lethal poison!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:05.680
Coco's not holding back, either!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.160
What was that just now?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.060
I've never seen those before...

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:51.330
Those eerie, foreboding 
electromagnetic waves...

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:53.500
He came from the ocean.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.970
He must have dived 1000 meters deep!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:57.970
Is there a living thing 
that can survive that?

00:20:57.970 --> 00:20:58.740
No...

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:02.470
It's not a living thing.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.450
T-This might be a scoop!

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:42.150
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:48.420
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:55.660
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:56.060 --> 00:22:00.600
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:05.740
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:09.110
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:13.580
on a journey with no end!

00:22:15.380 --> 00:22:18.550
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.690
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:27.660
amid the waves of time.

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:32.430
Gourmet News!

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:35.300
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:38.570
The ingredients that Toriko 
and Coco captured today are:

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:44.510
Puffer Whale (Marine Mammal) Capture Level 29

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:44.510
Puffer Whale!

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:44.740
According to Toriko, they ate 
it as sashimi and in hot sake.

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:48.380
The sweetness of Puffer Whale 
lingers in your mouth for two days,

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.250
and after drinking sake with it,

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:53.050
your body stays warm for 
a week! Or so I hear...

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:56.290
Each time you bite into the sashimi, 
the flavor expands, but do it too much

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:57.720
and the muscles in your jaw will hurt!

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.890
You won't be able to open 
your mouth for a few days.

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:04.460
And now, the next story...

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:11.020
A species thought extinct appears here in the Gourmet Colosseum!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.880
I'm moved at the sight of it's majestic appearance!

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:17.010
The Strongest Wolf That Ever Lived! The Battle Wolf Is Reborn!

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:19.370
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
